{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-realtime-sync-model","title":"库存实时同步模型与一致性语义（可售/预留/在途/超卖窗口）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/inventory-price-sync/inventory-realtime-sync-model","wordCount":2595,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"库存实时同步模型与一致性语义-可售-预留-在途-超卖窗口\">库存实时同步模型与一致性语义（可售/预留/在途/超卖窗口）</h1><p>代发链路上真正卖出去的每一个数字，都不是「仓库里有多少」，而是「此刻有多少可以承诺」。一件代发的卖家没有自己的货架，可售量是供应商库存、已下单未发货的占用、在途补货与安全缓冲这几笔账算出来的派生量。它每隔几十毫秒就可能变一次，一旦算错，代价是超卖取消或者少卖少赚。本文讨论如何把这几个量建模清楚，以及各方对「一致」定义不同时如何用一套自洽的语义驱动同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>库存不是一个标量，而是一组<strong>互斥的状态量</strong>。以 Shopify 的库存模型为例，每个库存项在某个位置（location）上被拆成多个命名量：<code>incoming</code>、<code>on_hand</code>、<code>available</code>、<code>committed</code>、<code>reserved</code>、<code>damaged</code>、<code>safety_stock</code>、<code>quality_control</code>（来源：Shopify「Apps in inventory management」文档，<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/orders-fulfillment/inventory-management-apps）。`on_hand`\">https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/orders-fulfillment/inventory-management-apps）。`on_hand`</a> 是物理在库总数，等于其余各状态之和；<code>incoming</code> 是唯一不代表「已在该位置」的量，描述在途、到货前不可销售。GraphQL Admin API 把它暴露为 <code>InventoryLevel</code> 对象，官方描述是「tracking multiple quantity states like available, on-hand, incoming, and committed」（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/InventoryLevel）。**下单改变的是状态分布，而不是总量**——下单使\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/InventoryLevel）。**下单改变的是状态分布，而不是总量**——下单使</a> <code>available</code> 减一、<code>committed</code> 加一，发货后 <code>committed</code> 再减一（来源同上），而 <code>on_hand</code> 不变。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[incoming&lt;br/&gt;在途, 不可售] --&gt;|到货入库| B[available&lt;br/&gt;可售]&#10;  B --&gt;|买家下单| C[committed&lt;br/&gt;已承诺]&#10;  C --&gt;|发货出库| D[离开库存]&#10;  B --&gt;|冻结/质检/损坏/缓冲| E[reserved / quality_control&lt;br/&gt;damaged / safety_stock]&#10;  E --&gt;|恢复| B\">graph TD\n  A[incoming&lt;br/&gt;在途, 不可售] --&gt;|到货入库| B[available&lt;br/&gt;可售]\n  B --&gt;|买家下单| C[committed&lt;br/&gt;已承诺]\n  C --&gt;|发货出库| D[离开库存]\n  B --&gt;|冻结/质检/损坏/缓冲| E[reserved / quality_control&lt;br/&gt;damaged / safety_stock]\n  E --&gt;|恢复| B</pre><p>不同系统对这组状态量的命名与粒度差异很大，对接时必须先做语义对齐，否则「同步成功」但两端含义不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>Shopify</th>\n<th>常见 ERP/WMS 叫法</th>\n<th>代发链路中的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物理在库</td>\n<td><code>on_hand</code></td>\n<td>on-hand / physical</td>\n<td>供应商仓实际有多少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可对外承诺</td>\n<td><code>available</code>（未含 <code>safety_stock</code>）</td>\n<td>ATP</td>\n<td>前台能展示的可售量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已占用</td>\n<td><code>committed</code></td>\n<td>allocated / reserved</td>\n<td>已下单待发货的占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途</td>\n<td><code>incoming</code></td>\n<td>in-transit / on-order</td>\n<td>补货在路上，不可售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可售预留</td>\n<td><code>reserved</code> / <code>safety_stock</code></td>\n<td>hold / quarantine</td>\n<td>冻结、质检、缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表要点是：<strong>对方 API 里叫 <code>available</code> 的字段未必等于你想要的可售量</strong>——很多供应商在 <code>available</code> 中已内置缓冲，你再叠一层就会少卖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可售量的代数关系与-atp-推导\">可售量的代数关系与 ATP 推导</h2><p>行业里把「可承诺量」称为 ATP（available to promise），定义是：<strong>一份 SKU 在不破坏既有承诺的前提下能向新订单承诺的数量</strong>，它不是 on-hand（来源：Orkestra「In-transit inventory &amp; available to promise」，<a href=\"https://www.orkestrascs.com/solutions/inventory-visibility/in-transit-inventory）。计算形态是一段沿时间轴前推的累计：\">https://www.orkestrascs.com/solutions/inventory-visibility/in-transit-inventory）。计算形态是一段沿时间轴前推的累计：</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>on_hand</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>allocated</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>safety_stock</mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>unalloc</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP(t) = \\bigl(\\text{on\\_hand} - \\text{allocated} - \\text{safety\\_stock}\\bigr) + \\sum_{\\tau \\le t} R(\\tau) - \\sum_{\\tau \\le t} D_{\\text{unalloc}}(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">on_hand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">allocated</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">safety_stock</span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4064em;vertical-align:-1.3564em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8888em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4064em;vertical-align:-1.3564em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8888em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unalloc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻计划到货的收货量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>unalloc</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{unalloc}}(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unalloc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是尚未被分配掉的承诺需求。这里有一处陷阱，Orkestra 明确点出：<strong>扣减的重复计算</strong>。如果你在起始的自由量里已把 allocations 扣掉，向前累计时就必须只减「未分配」的需求；否则同一批订单被减两次，每个时间桶都显得比实际更紧。两种自洽口径是——从 on-hand 净掉分配、向前只数未分配需求；或保留 on-hand 毛值、把每条已承诺订单按它要求的日期全额减掉（更易审计）。代发场景 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum R(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 通常退化为零，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> supplier_available</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>local_committed</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP \\approx \\max(0,\\ \\text{supplier\\_available} - \\text{local\\_committed} - B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">supplier_available</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">local_committed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为本地缓冲）——分子里两个量来自外部，只有 committed 本地可控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性语义-从比较交换到幂等写\">一致性语义：从比较交换到幂等写</h2><p>同步的本质问题不是「传得准不准」，而是「并发写谁赢」。供应商库存会被多方同时修改：供应商自己的系统、多个代发商、以及你自己的订单占用。一个没有并发保护的绝对写入（set quantity = 12）在两个请求并发时会丢失一次更新。Shopify 给库存写入提供<strong>比较交换（compare-and-set）</strong>：<code>inventorySetQuantities</code> 用绝对值设置数量，只有当前持久化数量等于传入的比较值时才更新，否则报错（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/mutations/inventorySetQuantities）。它只应由「作为库存真相源」的系统调用，其他情况应改用增量式的\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/mutations/inventorySetQuantities）。它只应由「作为库存真相源」的系统调用，其他情况应改用增量式的</a> <code>inventoryAdjustQuantities</code>。</p>\n<p>这套接口在 2026 年发生了两次重要变化，对接方必须按版本适配（来源：Shopify changelog「Improved compare and swap inventory updates」，<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/changelog/compare-and-swap-redesign-for-inventory-set-quantities）：**2026-01\">https://shopify.dev/changelog/compare-and-swap-redesign-for-inventory-set-quantities）：**2026-01</a>** 引入 <code>changeFromQuantity</code> 字段显式声明是否做比较检查（传整数做检查，传 <code>null</code> 跳过），旧的 <code>compareQuantity</code> / <code>ignoreCompareQuantity</code> 自此废弃；<strong>2026-04</strong> 旧字段完全移除，同一时期 <code>inventoryAdjustQuantities</code> 的幂等键从可选变为<strong>必需</strong>，须通过 <code>@idempotent</code> 指令提供（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/mutations/inventoryAdjustQuantities）。幂等键解决的是：库存扣减在网络超时后重试时，若服务端已成功而客户端不知道，没有幂等键就会扣两次（Shopify\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/mutations/inventoryAdjustQuantities）。幂等键解决的是：库存扣减在网络超时后重试时，若服务端已成功而客户端不知道，没有幂等键就会扣两次（Shopify</a> 建议用随机 UUID 作键，来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/usage/idempotent-requests）。\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/usage/idempotent-requests）。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一致性级别</th>\n<th>实现手段</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>每次下单都同步调用供应商锁库存</td>\n<td>下单延迟随供应商 RT 上升，供应商不可用即不可下单</td>\n<td>高价值、低并发 SKU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比较交换</td>\n<td>CAS 写入 + 冲突重试</td>\n<td>冲突率随并发上升</td>\n<td>供给方可写、并发中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量事件</td>\n<td>只同步 delta + 幂等键 + 序号</td>\n<td>需处理乱序、重复、丢失</td>\n<td>高频变动、多写方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期对账</td>\n<td>定时全量比对 + 差异修正</td>\n<td>窗口内必然存在偏差</td>\n<td>兜底，不做主路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产系统几乎从不只用一种：主路径用增量事件 + 序号去重，写入用比较交换保底，周期对账做最终收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超卖窗口的量化模型\">超卖窗口的量化模型</h2><p>超卖不是「算错了」，而是<strong>决策依据过期了</strong>。前台在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 读到的可售量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 - L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻的真实值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是同步延迟。在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_0-L, t_0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 窗口内，任何发生在别处、还没传回来的占用，对前台都是不可见的。设窗口内订单到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、单笔平均件数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、窗口开始时真实可售量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，则期望超卖量近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>oversell</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{oversell}] \\approx \\mathbb{E}[(\\lambda q L - a)^{+}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">oversell</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。这不是精确预测模型，价值在于把杠杆显式化：降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>（限流或拆单）、抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>（保留缓冲）；代发场景下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 在促销期不可控，真正能拧的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>。窗口漏得有多大可参考行业数据：一份 2026 年的统计给出代发卖家平均 15–20% 的断货率（stockout rate）（来源：WorldMetrics「Dropshipping Industry Statistics: 2026 Market Report」，<a href=\"https://worldmetrics.org/dropshipping-industry-statistics/），应作量级参考。供应商侧工具也围绕它：DSers\">https://worldmetrics.org/dropshipping-industry-statistics/），应作量级参考。供应商侧工具也围绕它：DSers</a> 的库存自动同步称「供应商库存时刻在变，早上有货下午可能售罄，不自动同步就只能每天手工查或者冒着超卖的风险」（来源：<a href=\"https://help.dsers.com/inventory-auto-sync-prevent-overselling/）。\">https://help.dsers.com/inventory-auto-sync-prevent-overselling/）。</a></p>\n<p>缓冲量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的作用是：不把全部可售量暴露给前台，只暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a - B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，这样窗口内所有竞争都发生在一个更小的量上。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 可借鉴安全库存的形态——正比于窗口内需求波动的标准差，比例系数由可接受的超卖率决定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = z \\cdot \\sigma_{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是延迟窗口内需求的标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 对应目标服务水平。调整缓冲的方向必须不对称，这与 TCP 拥塞控制一致：RFC 5681 定义的 AIMD 要求检测到拥塞时立刻减窗、无拥塞时逐步增窗（来源：RFC 5681《TCP Congestion Control》，<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5681）。库存缓冲同理——**收紧立即生效**（少暴露只是少卖），**放宽必须等延迟恢复并持续一段时间**，因为放宽那一瞬间所有渠道余量同时上升，若延迟仍高，超卖立刻发生。\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5681）。库存缓冲同理——**收紧立即生效**（少暴露只是少卖），**放宽必须等延迟恢复并持续一段时间**，因为放宽那一瞬间所有渠道余量同时上升，若延迟仍高，超卖立刻发生。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"事件契约与乱序处理\">事件契约与乱序处理</h2><p>增量同步的可靠性取决于事件契约是否完整。一个能支撑乱序、重复与丢失恢复的库存事件至少需要三个字段：<strong>幂等键</strong>（去重）、<strong>版本号或逻辑时钟</strong>（判断新旧）、<strong>库存项的完整定位</strong>（item + location + 数量名的三元组，因为同一 SKU 在不同位置、不同数量名上是不同的量）。定位在 Shopify 的模型里是必须的：<code>InventoryLevel</code> 明确是「一个 InventoryItem 在一个 Location 上」的连接，<code>quantities</code> 字段必须带 <code>names</code> 参数指定读取哪些数量名（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/InventoryLevel）。\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/InventoryLevel）。</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E1[变更事件&lt;br/&gt;幂等键 + 版本号] --&gt; Q[去重与排序缓冲]&#10;  Q --&gt;|version 更高| A[应用变更]&#10;  Q --&gt;|version 更低| D[丢弃, 记迟到]&#10;  A --&gt; W[CAS 写入]&#10;  W --&gt;|冲突| R[拉最新值重试]&#10;  W --&gt;|成功| P[发布到前台]&#10;  P --&gt; S[周期对账修正漂移]\">graph TD\n  E1[变更事件&lt;br/&gt;幂等键 + 版本号] --&gt; Q[去重与排序缓冲]\n  Q --&gt;|version 更高| A[应用变更]\n  Q --&gt;|version 更低| D[丢弃, 记迟到]\n  A --&gt; W[CAS 写入]\n  W --&gt;|冲突| R[拉最新值重试]\n  W --&gt;|成功| P[发布到前台]\n  P --&gt; S[周期对账修正漂移]</pre><p>一处常被忽视的细节：<strong>版本号必须是每个库存定位维度上的单调量，而不是全局时间戳</strong>。用带时钟偏差的墙上时间排序，会在跨节点同步时产生「新事件被判为旧」的稳定错误。更稳的做法是每个 (item, location, name) 三元组维护一个自增序号，或用供应商返回的 <code>updatedAt</code>（<code>InventoryLevel</code> 提供了该字段）配合本地序号校验。对账是最后一道保险：无论链路多严密，总会有语义错误（比如供应商改了商品的计量单位，事件里却没体现）逃过结构校验，周期全量对账的职责就是发现这类<strong>语义漂移</strong>——它不负责及时性，只负责最终收敛。</p>\n<p>回到本 hub 的定位。本文只处理「库存量如何建模与同步」这一层，供应商如何接入、能力如何建模见 <a href=\"../dropship-model-supplier-network/dropship-fulfillment-models-taxonomy\">代发履约模式与商业模型分类</a>。判据是：问题是「这个数怎么算出来、怎么保证它不陈旧」属于本文，问题是「算出来之后这个单发给谁」属于后续章节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>库存不是标量，而是 <code>available</code> / <code>committed</code> / <code>reserved</code> / <code>incoming</code> / <code>safety_stock</code> 等<strong>互斥状态量</strong>的集合；下单只改变状态分布，不改变 <code>on_hand</code>。</li>\n<li>可售量 ATP 是派生量：<code>on_hand − allocated − safety_stock + Σ收货 − Σ未分配需求</code>。最容易犯的错是把已分配需求扣两次。</li>\n<li>并发写的工具是比较交换（CAS）与幂等键。Shopify 在 2026-01 用 <code>changeFromQuantity</code> 取代 <code>compareQuantity</code>，2026-04 起强制 <code>inventoryAdjustQuantities</code> 携带幂等键。</li>\n<li>超卖窗口期望规模约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda q L - a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>（正部分），可拧的旋钮是延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与缓冲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>；缓冲调整必须不对称（收紧立即、放宽滞后），与 RFC 5681 的 AIMD 同源。</li>\n<li>事件契约需要幂等键 + 每个定位维度上的单调版本号 + 完整的 (item, location, name) 三元组；结构校验之外还需周期对账捕获语义漂移。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"库存实时同步模型与一致性语义（可售/预留/在途/超卖窗口）","id":"库存实时同步模型与一致性语义-可售-预留-在途-超卖窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可售量的代数关系与 ATP 推导","id":"可售量的代数关系与-atp-推导"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性语义：从比较交换到幂等写","id":"一致性语义-从比较交换到幂等写"},{"level":2,"text":"超卖窗口的量化模型","id":"超卖窗口的量化模型"},{"level":2,"text":"事件契约与乱序处理","id":"事件契约与乱序处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"供应商寻源、分层与履约质量运营（后备供货、比价、淘汰机制）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/dropship-model-supplier-network/supplier-network-sourcing-tier-ops"},"next":{"title":"价目与成本同步管道（API 拉取/Feed 文件/Webhook 推送与频次权衡）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/inventory-price-sync/price-cost-sync-pipeline"}}